                "To serve and measure ads, Google may process your device's advertising identifier (Android Advertising ID or iOS IDFA), your IP address and the approximate location estimated from it, records of ads you viewed and tapped, app and device information, and diagnostic data such as errors and performance. You can learn how Google uses this information at <a href=\"https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites\">How Google uses information from sites or apps that use our services</a>.",
                "On iPhone, the game asks whether you want to allow tracking the first time you launch it. If you do not allow tracking, your IDFA is not shared with Google and ads will not be personalized using your IDFA. Your gameplay and rewards remain the same either way. You can change this setting later under Settings > Privacy & Security > Tracking.",
